@startuml F0.5-b-erro-4xx
title F0.5-b — API 4xx → /erro/:codigo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "TanStack Query" as TQ
participant "API" as API

Usuario -> WebApp: ação autenticada
WebApp -> TQ: request
TQ -> API: HTTP com JWT

alt 401 sessão expirada
  API --> TQ: 401
  note right of TQ
    Refresh implícito (F0.1-f)
    antes do redirect, se houver
  end note
  TQ --> WebApp: /erro/401
else 403 sem capability
  API --> TQ: 403 access_denied
  TQ --> WebApp: /erro/403
else 404 recurso de API
  API --> TQ: 404
  TQ --> WebApp: /erro/404
end

WebApp --> Usuario: tela /erro/:codigo\n(botões conforme status)

@enduml
